      "version": 507,
      "versionNonce": 432700783,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785592167529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Repo structure\n\nrag\n- core (contains the shared things like exception etc)\n    - shared_uitls\n    - exceptions\n- database - mysql database(postgres) for information storage\n              - vectordatabase(chroma) for vectorembeddings storage\ningestion - parser (reads the pdf and text file)\n            - splitter(creates chunk)\nllm - primary_model \n    - backup_model\n\napp\n- router (endpoints)\n- schems (input validator)\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Repo structure\n\nrag\n- core (contains the shared things like exception etc)\n    - shared_uitls\n    - exceptions\n- database - mysql database(postgres) for information storage\n              - vectordatabase(chroma) for vectorembeddings storage\ningestion - parser (reads the pdf and text file)\n            - splitter(creates chunk)\nllm - primary_model \n    - backup_model\n\napp\n- router (endpoints)\n- schems (input validator)\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
